# Node
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Rust target dir is at workspace root, not here, but if any local
# `cargo build` against the FFI crate drops a per-crate target dir
# (e.g. for editor LSPs), ignore it.
crates/prover-ffi/target/

# Heavy binary artefacts produced by `uniffi-bindgen-react-native
# build {ios,android}`. These are rebuilt on every CI run from the
# Rust sources; tracking them would bloat the repo for nothing.
#
# iOS xcframework slices are typically ~70 MB each; Android .so
# files are 12-17 MB per ABI × 4 ABIs = ~60 MB. We track the path
# placeholders + a .gitkeep so the directory shape is preserved.
ios/MidnightProver.xcframework/
android/src/main/jniLibs/*/libmidnight_prover_ffi.so

# Generated TS + C++ bindings — produced by
# `uniffi-bindgen-react-native generate jsi {bindings,turbo-module}`
# at build time. Reproducible from the UDL + Rust sources; tracking
# them invites stale-binding bugs.
src/generated/
cpp/generated/

# UniFFI scaffolding output cargo writes alongside its target dir.
**/uniffi-bindgen-react-native-*

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.log
